WEBVTT

00:26.420 --> 00:30.720
Such a slow attack won't ever hit me!

00:30.720 --> 00:34.180
Not when I'm as fast as sound!

00:36.390 --> 00:37.730
See?!

00:45.370 --> 00:47.690
Too bad, you miss!

00:47.690 --> 00:51.530
By the way,
I am talking super fast now!

00:51.530 --> 00:53.830
Stop yapping all the time, you scrap!

00:54.240 --> 00:56.700
What's so amazing about avoiding it?

00:57.120 --> 01:00.420
You're not doing any damage
to the enemy yourself!

01:00.830 --> 01:01.620
Shut up!

01:01.620 --> 01:04.629
I can't use my main weapon
in a space like this!

03:31.730 --> 03:36.200
RAGNA CRIMSON

03:39.450 --> 03:42.950
CHAPTER 21: NO NEED FOR WORDS

03:57.130 --> 03:59.800
Hey! Don't just watch, attack already!

03:59.800 --> 04:01.220
Hmph!

04:01.220 --> 04:04.520
Currently, we have no means
to damage that giant.

04:04.520 --> 04:07.520
You're useless too, aren't you now?

04:19.490 --> 04:20.740
Time out!

04:45.060 --> 04:47.310
Ouch...

04:47.310 --> 04:49.310
That's a foul!

04:49.310 --> 04:51.810
You shouldn't attack me now!

04:56.780 --> 04:59.010
Foul? Time out?

04:59.010 --> 05:01.700
Stop saying lame shit like that!

05:01.700 --> 05:05.490
Murder has no rule!

05:13.500 --> 05:18.130
Oopsie! My stomach suddenly hurts,
give me a break...

05:36.230 --> 05:39.150
Here we go!

05:49.450 --> 05:51.830
Impossible! I'm being pushed back?!

05:52.120 --> 05:55.880
They're stronger from back then
even without the Silverware Princess?!

05:59.050 --> 06:02.760
Especially this gramp!
He is off the charts!

06:09.390 --> 06:14.290
He sure has support around,
but he still fights me head-on.

06:15.730 --> 06:22.950
Moreover, I spread tasteless and odorless
poison since the start of the fight...

06:23.240 --> 06:27.200
It must've worked, especially without
Silverware Princess's protection.

06:29.540 --> 06:30.580
So it was you!

06:43.800 --> 06:45.750
Don't underestimate us.

06:45.750 --> 06:46.930
Hit him hard!

06:50.640 --> 06:55.270
Someone like you is no match for us,
not after we passed that hell!

07:15.540 --> 07:16.870
My brother in arm...

07:17.710 --> 07:20.850
How could you fight
so hard back then?

07:21.920 --> 07:26.590
I want my last to be
just like yours.

08:19.850 --> 08:24.020
Self-frenzied: 300%.

09:49.400 --> 09:53.150
That is such a beautiful light.
Right, My Princess?

09:55.530 --> 09:58.330
My Princess, I...

09:58.330 --> 10:00.330
Is that you... Nazarena?

10:01.500 --> 10:03.670
Why are you holding me?

10:04.790 --> 10:08.630
Don't use... your time...

10:09.920 --> 10:12.810
for a dying person like me...

10:13.760 --> 10:16.970
Enough with... me...

10:18.430 --> 10:20.270
Go!

10:21.890 --> 10:23.530
My Princess! My...

10:33.860 --> 10:35.850
It is a pleasure to meet you,

10:36.530 --> 10:38.490
Lady Starlia.

10:38.780 --> 10:43.370
I've been entrusted to be
your tutor starting from...

10:44.080 --> 10:45.540
...today.

10:47.040 --> 10:49.590
My name is Nazarena Teluzian.

10:52.590 --> 10:56.140
The Royal Family is a lineage
seen as a presence above the sky

10:56.140 --> 10:58.300
by the commoners.

10:58.300 --> 11:01.140
That blood is precious,
as well as perfect.

11:01.560 --> 11:05.310
So a member of the blood
shouldn't be born with defects.

11:05.310 --> 11:07.480
That's just how the world goes.

11:07.940 --> 11:11.570
You were supposed to be a stillbirth.

11:13.780 --> 11:15.860
The reason why it isn't so

11:15.860 --> 11:19.740
is because your special ability
is expected to be of value.

11:22.080 --> 11:25.290
Stop pretending to be a beast
who can't understand human speech.

11:25.290 --> 11:26.620
You're intelligent.

11:27.630 --> 11:30.750
I am assured the moment I laid
eyes on you directly.

11:30.750 --> 11:34.300
You can grasp every aura emitted
by every material in the world.

11:34.800 --> 11:36.330
If you feel like it...

11:36.330 --> 11:39.010
Just by thinking of it,
you can rip people to shreds.

11:39.720 --> 11:42.810
The fact you haven't done
so means you understand, right?

11:42.810 --> 11:44.560
Once you do it,

11:44.560 --> 11:49.340
there will be no place
that would accept you anymore.

11:49.730 --> 11:51.940
That's a clever decision.

11:51.940 --> 11:55.360
It's not true...
that I want to be accepted!

11:55.360 --> 11:58.230
I want to stand on the top!

12:01.870 --> 12:04.830
Then you have to embrace power.

12:04.830 --> 12:09.000
If you want their treatment to change,
instead of hurling your dissatisfaction,

12:09.000 --> 12:10.880
you must show your worth.

12:11.190 --> 12:13.920
I will teach you all you need.

12:13.920 --> 12:16.390
First, from manners.

12:16.390 --> 12:18.840
I believe you understand, My Princess?

12:23.680 --> 12:27.270
Goodbye, My Princess.
It was a lot of fun.

12:28.600 --> 12:31.230
So much, I even forgot
about my mission...

12:42.990 --> 12:44.230
Something's coming.

12:48.460 --> 12:51.540
To the "Outer Dimension"
where Lady Ultimatia is evacuating.

12:53.090 --> 12:57.050
They're trying to forcibly take
the governing authority from me!

12:58.090 --> 12:59.050
It's her!

13:02.850 --> 13:06.470
Password: 56, 34, 18, 92.

13:06.470 --> 13:11.520
Authentication lock intrusion,
detection door tracking, high-speed discovery.

13:11.520 --> 13:12.400
Barrier abrasion...

13:12.730 --> 13:16.110
She's fast! She can breach
the barrier in an instant?!

13:18.360 --> 13:21.100
How could she manifest so fast?!
This is impossible!

13:21.100 --> 13:23.530
The Former Monarch's legacy
is destroyed this fast?

13:25.660 --> 13:27.490
This is bad! They'll rob it away!

13:27.910 --> 13:31.080
It's 60 seconds until
the last barrier is breached!

13:31.080 --> 13:34.170
No, 40! 30?!
It's rapidly accelerating!

13:34.710 --> 13:36.210
I can't hold it anymore!

13:45.510 --> 13:49.430
I can't give up! This is my duty!
I swore an oath!

13:49.430 --> 13:53.100
If you lose in skill, then learn it
from the enemy quickly!

13:53.520 --> 13:56.190
I'll show you that I'm a genius!

14:23.840 --> 14:26.180
Lady Ultimatia!

14:27.680 --> 14:28.640
Nebu...

14:28.640 --> 14:31.980
The genius's meat tastes so good!

14:44.530 --> 14:45.410
Who are you?!

14:47.160 --> 14:48.120
Spatial Control.

14:48.990 --> 14:53.580
Setting the presence requirement within
the space as "those who are Winged Monarch."

14:54.120 --> 14:55.460
Time Control.

14:55.460 --> 14:59.340
Set the passage of time within the space
to be three times the outside world.

14:59.340 --> 15:01.000
Now, no one can interfere.

15:01.840 --> 15:04.660
Even if she regains her magic,

15:04.660 --> 15:07.590
it's on a different dimension
so it won't affect the outside.

15:08.970 --> 15:11.810
My wound is not healing?

15:12.600 --> 15:13.770
But...!

15:14.180 --> 15:15.480
Anger.

15:18.940 --> 15:23.070
The one I fear is not you!

15:26.590 --> 15:27.390
Tch.

15:28.740 --> 15:30.910
Released the third barrier.

15:31.660 --> 15:33.790
Released the fourth barrier.

15:41.330 --> 15:43.030
Are you sure you want to do this?

15:44.260 --> 15:46.680
Before making a critical decision,

15:46.680 --> 15:49.470
I always discuss it
with myself objectively.

15:49.470 --> 15:51.660
It's a rule I made for myself.

15:52.680 --> 15:53.810
I sure did.

15:58.230 --> 16:00.970
I am being too emotional.

16:01.480 --> 16:05.860
To risk my life over what that
commoner says is sheer stupidity.

16:05.860 --> 16:08.650
Do you want to repeat
the same mistake as that time?

16:08.650 --> 16:10.530
I have a counter-argument.

16:10.530 --> 16:12.530
The situation is different
from back then.

16:13.080 --> 16:14.470
If I don't move now,

16:14.470 --> 16:16.790
the steps my past self took
will be for naught.

16:17.290 --> 16:21.000
Is that commoner
really worth that much?

16:21.290 --> 16:24.760
At the very least,
my past self thinks so.

16:25.210 --> 16:28.550
You said I'll feel extreme pain and die,

16:29.260 --> 16:31.090
but that was just a ruse, huh?

16:31.930 --> 16:33.660
I only get a bit dizzy.

16:34.350 --> 16:38.020
At least enough that he'd send
antibodies against the poison.

16:38.440 --> 16:41.130
Even if you take your heart back now,

16:41.130 --> 16:43.730
the power you get
won't even reach ten percent.

16:44.650 --> 16:49.700
Then, isn't it better to fight while
still being immortal without the heart?

16:50.320 --> 16:53.430
I can't kill a massive presence
like a Winged Monarch

16:54.030 --> 16:57.290
as a sparse presence
that doesn't die nor live.

16:57.580 --> 17:01.670
But there is no reason
why I can't kill that amateur

17:01.670 --> 17:04.190
once I get back
several percent of my power.

17:05.000 --> 17:06.170
Overconfident, are you?

17:09.720 --> 17:10.589
No.

17:12.220 --> 17:13.260
That is a fact.

17:22.230 --> 17:24.310
Now, let's kill her.

17:38.250 --> 17:41.120
S-Such a thing won't work on me!

17:46.590 --> 17:48.210
It does work.

17:49.050 --> 17:51.050
This bullet is for my suicide.

17:51.840 --> 17:53.840
It destroys the blood flow

17:53.840 --> 17:56.050
and makes magic impossible to use.

17:59.980 --> 18:02.940
Just like me, you're the owner
of Time Control Magic.

18:03.690 --> 18:06.520
As long as your blood flows like mine,
it will surely work.

18:07.770 --> 18:09.270
I have 12 bullets.

18:09.270 --> 18:10.240
Now it's ten left.

18:11.790 --> 18:14.320
It only takes one bullet
in the heart to finish her.

18:14.660 --> 18:15.700
Bust through.

18:16.830 --> 18:17.700
Accel.

18:17.700 --> 18:19.950
Five times, ten times.

18:22.870 --> 18:23.870
Accel Bullet.

18:38.010 --> 18:38.970
She swerved it.

18:40.930 --> 18:43.390
Then my next aim
will include the deviation.

18:46.230 --> 18:47.610
Accel.

18:47.610 --> 18:50.030
Five times, ten times.

18:52.990 --> 18:56.570
Get away from me!

19:08.290 --> 19:09.750
The sun has risen!

19:10.340 --> 19:12.920
With this, that guy will be weakened...

19:12.920 --> 19:17.470
With my certain death
a few minutes away...

19:17.470 --> 19:19.810
I finally figured it out.

19:24.600 --> 19:27.980
No emptiness nor deception is left.

19:30.020 --> 19:32.030
All the time that is left for me...

19:32.440 --> 19:34.030
All of it...

19:34.610 --> 19:36.780
...is only to kill.

19:39.620 --> 19:42.040
Retreat! Retreat at once!

19:42.040 --> 19:44.120
With time self-frenzied will not hold...

19:49.250 --> 19:50.250
Thanks.

19:55.340 --> 19:57.590
This is the only one we have.

19:57.590 --> 19:59.830
Fu! You...

20:00.600 --> 20:05.100
If I can't regain myself,
I will leave the aftermath to you.

20:09.980 --> 20:11.480
Dragon Arm Release.

20:17.070 --> 20:21.910
I want you to research the practicality
of the teleportation magic circle.

20:22.140 --> 20:24.040
What is it for?

20:24.040 --> 20:28.540
Of course, it's for when I want
to enact a coup d'etat!

20:28.540 --> 20:31.420
You understand
why I say this to you, right?

20:31.670 --> 20:35.170
It is to declare that I have
no intention of letting you go.

20:50.190 --> 20:52.060
Magic absorption.

21:15.630 --> 21:16.760
Fu!

21:26.750 --> 21:29.640
I lost my arm...

21:30.440 --> 21:31.600
...and foot.

21:32.150 --> 21:34.410
Ain't no way...

21:34.410 --> 21:37.820
I'm the most talented in the corps...

21:38.110 --> 21:40.510
They all said so!

21:42.070 --> 21:43.990
If I'm this brittle,

21:44.410 --> 21:47.990
then it's as if the whole
Argentum Corps are brittle!

21:49.160 --> 21:51.960
I do not need any future beyond this.

21:58.260 --> 21:59.970
Just for this one moment!

22:01.170 --> 22:02.590
To reach that height...

22:07.680 --> 22:08.930
I will fly!
